Zheng, Weihao Zhuang, YingPing He, Tian Liu, Yong Yang, Di Wang, Yuhong Liu, Jie Jiang, Jingwei Huang, and Chunchao Guo\nPublication year 2025\nPublication / source arXiv:2501.12202\nPublication type Preprint\nPrimary research role Foundations & surveys\nResearch roles Foundations & surveys Build & maintain\nResearch topics Role: foundation Role: build Foundational methods and concepts Video and learned world models Procedural content generation\nOriginal publication Original publication https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.12202 \nPDF PDF https://arxiv.org/pdf/2501.12202 \narXiv ID 2501.12202\nDOI 10.48550/arxiv.2501.12202\nRelated resources Hunyuan3D 2.0 /resources/hunyuan3d-2/ \nBibliographic sources Primary publication https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.12202 \nClassification context Editorial roles and topics follow the publication’s scope as discussed in GameMap. Foundations denotes a general method or component, rather than a game-specific system.\nCode availability Code with restricted terms\nRepositories & licenses Tencent-Hunyuan/Hunyuan3D-2 (implementation) Repository https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hunyuan3D-2 Implementation scope Research implementation License status Restricted license Code license Tencent Hunyuan community license License source https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hunyuan3D-2/blob/main/LICENSE\nDemos & setup Try Hunyuan3D 2.0 Demo / setup instructions https://huggingface.co/spaces/tencent/Hunyuan3D-2 Experience type Online interactive demo Access conditions Public access Usage notes Official public Space API reports RUNNING. ZeroGPU queues, quotas or sign-in rules may apply; Tencent model community terms remain relevant. Run the local Gradio generator Demo / setup instructions https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hunyuan3D-2#readme Experience type Documented local run Access conditions Local setup required Usage notes Install dependencies and obtain model weights; README lists about 6 GB VRAM for shape, 16 GB for shape plus texture.\nPractical use note